        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  ... I'm not sure anymore. But, I will do my part.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "... I'm not sure anymore. But, I will do my part."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
